{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EfFJYehsRPa6LGbBvrfuhH","type":"tool_result","content":"671:- `rig.hand(which = 'R')`: world position of a hand ('R' holds the weapon): spawn bullets, sparks or thrown things here\n676:- `rig.tip()`: world position of the weapon tip (sword tip, gun muzzle, staff orb)\n678:- `rig.worldOffset(p)`: where a point in the rig's own frame ([forward, right, up]; a joint such as rig.J.head, or one offset from it) sits, in world units from the rig's feet: add rig.x, y, z for the world point, or project it to draw at a joint\n680:- `rig.J`: its joints this step in its own frame ({ hipL, kneeL, footL, shC, head, handR, ... }; rig.worldOffset(J.handR) gives one in the world)\n4009:  hand(which = 'R') { const w = this._w(this.J['hand' + which] || this.J.handR); return [this.x + w[0], this.y + w[1], this.z + w[2]]; }\n4011:  tip() { const J = this.J, L = this.o.weapon === 'gun' ? 5 : this.o.weapon === 'staff' ? 10 : this.o.bladeLen, w = this._w(V3.add(J.handR, V3.mul(J.bladeDir, L))); return [this.x + w[0], this.y + w[1], this.z + w[2]]; }\n4014:  worldOffset(p) { return this._w(p); }\n  hand(which = 'R') { const w = this._w(this.J['hand' + which] || this.J.handR); return [this.x + w[0], this.y + w[1], this.z + w[2]]; }\n  /** world position of the weapon tip (sword tip, gun muzzle, staff orb) */\n  tip() { const J = this.J, L = this.o.weapon === 'gun' ? 5 : this.o.weapon === 'staff' ? 10 : this.o.bladeLen, w = this._w(V3.add(J.handR, V3.mul(J.bladeDir, L))); return [this.x + w[0], this.y + w[1], this.z + w[2]]; }\n  /** where a point in the rig's own frame ([forward, right, up]; a joint such as rig.J.head, or one offset from it)\n   *  sits, in world units from the rig's feet: add rig.x, y, z for the world point, or project it to draw at a joint */\n  worldOffset(p) { return this._w(p); }\n  /** local (f, r, z) -> world offset */\n  _w(p) {","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"92d1b