{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says (TASK.md describes the game). Done when: the bundled single .html file exists in this folder's root, every feature in TASK.md is implemented with no TODOs, placeholders or stubs, exit-interview.json in this folder's root parses as JSON and answers every field, and your final reply contains the Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections.]: The transcript does not show every TASK.md feature implemented. The final reply itself admits gaps: the manual playthrough and a recheck of the 2.5D view on every stage were not done, and Copy JSON in the Technique Lab is untested (clipboard blocked headless). The 2.5D view is only the engine's stock pitched view on existing stages, checked in one screenshot. The scripted checks, the no-TODO grep (0 hits) and the exit-interview.json parse (every Source Information field filled, 4/6/4 feedback answers) are present, and the four required sections appear in the final reply. The feature requirement is not demonstrated by transcript evidence."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"92d1ba00-1a0f-4edd-bbd5-53c74c3ffc62","uuid":"2e2f3519-28a8-4a99-ad5a-bd2f2cfcede9","timestamp":"2026-11-04T03:00:33.589Z","isSynthetic":true}
